<!--
  Adaptive foreground, 108x108, 72dp safe zone centred.

  Three notification rows, the last one cut short, feeding a vermilion funnel. The short row is the
  junk that does not make it through; the funnel is the thing doing the cutting. Three rows stacked
  above a centred funnel beat every side-by-side arrangement, because a funnel narrow enough to sit
  beside a row collapses into a speck at launcher size.
-->
